  "description": "The bounds the server puts on the diagnostics and log groups of a heartbeat, and how it measures a diagnostic's size, which the agent keeps to when it builds them. The server (`diagnostics_up_to` in server/src/configuration_attempt.rs and `log_summary` in server/src/device.rs) and the agent (`finalize` and `fitDiagnostic` in agent/internal/agent/diagnose.go, `summaries` in vectorlog.go) read this one file in their tests, so a change to a bound on one side shows up on the other. A diagnostic's size is its compact JSON as the server measures it: the record it parsed and serialized again, which escapes only the quotation mark, the backslash and the characters below U+0020 and writes everything else as UTF-8.",
